# SHA-256 of the prebuilt libwebrtc that flutter_webrtc downloads for
# Windows and Linux (checked by tool/ci/check_libwebrtc.py after the build).
#
#   <sha256>  <binary_version>/<platform>/<file name>
#
# Taken from the official webrtc-sdk/libwebrtc release zips. A new
# libwebrtc (binary_version in flutter_webrtc's libwebrtc_version.ini)
# needs new lines here; a file whose hash differs from its line fails
# the build, and the release build fails on a file without a line.
